      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty strong case. but i keep seeing people say it's just going to cause crazy inflation or that it's impossible to actually fund without crashing the economy. are those just typical political talking points to protect the status quo, or is there actually any legitimate economic basis to those concerns?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
